    "name": "makeitem",
    "arity": {
      "min": 5,
      "max": 6
    },
    "parameterTypes": "visii?",
    "signatures": [
      "makeitem <item id>,<amount>,\"<map name>\",<X>,<Y>{,<canShowEffect>};",
      "makeitem \"<item name>\",<amount>,\"<map name>\",<X>,<Y>{,<canShowEffect>};"
    ],
    "documentation": "This command will create an item on the specified cell of a map.\n\nAs with any dropped items, the items created with this command will disappear after\na period of time. Using an amount greater than 1 will create a single stack of the\ngiven amount, not multiple stacks of 1.\n\nLike 'getitem', it also accepts an 'english name' field from the database and creates\nApples if the name isn't found.\nIf the map name is given as \"this\", the map the invoking character is on will be used.\nIf <canShowEffect> flag is set to true, it will show a pillar effect on the ground when dropped, depending on the item database's DropEffect flag.\n\n---------------------------------------",
