    "documentation": "This command will warp a <GID> to the specified map and coordinates.\n\nIf <GID> is zero, the command runs for the unit that invoked the script. This can be\nused with \"OnTouch\" to warp monsters:\n\nOnTouch:\n\tunitwarp 0,\"this\",-1,-1;\n\n---------------------------------------",
